---
import PrototypeLayout from "@/layouts/PrototypeLayout.astro";
---

<PrototypeLayout
  title="Homepage prototype comparison — OpenAgent.bot"
  description="Compare two homepage design directions for OpenAgent.bot."
  path="/prototypes"
  themeColor="#ecece7"
>
  <main class="compare-page">
    <header>
      <a class="back" href="/">← OpenAgent.bot</a>
      <span class="label">Visual direction study / 2026</span>
      <h1>Two ways to make the<br /><em>open ecosystem visible.</em></h1>
      <p>Both prototypes use live Registry entities and keep incomplete ranking history visibly labeled. Open either direction, click project rows and test it at desktop or mobile width.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="options" aria-label="Homepage design prototypes">
      <article class="option index-option">
        <a class="preview" href="/prototypes/live-index" aria-label="Open Live Open Index prototype">
          <div class="mini-nav"><i>OA</i><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>SUPPORT</b></div>
          <div class="mini-index-hero"><h2>Open(Source)<br /><em>Agent(s)</em> × <strong>(Ro)Bot</strong></h2><aside><b>158</b><span></span><span></span><span></span></aside></div>
          <div class="mini-tape">OPEN SIGNAL · AGENTS · ROBOTS · LIVE INDEX</div>
          <div class="mini-boards"><div><b>AGENT INDEX</b><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div><b>ROBOT INDEX</b><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
          <span class="open-cue">Open prototype ↗</span>
        </a>
        <div class="option-copy">
          <div><span>01</span><h2>Live Open Index</h2></div>
          <p>Fast, competitive and data-forward. Rankings and daily movement become the brand’s main visual object.</p>
          <ul><li>Strongest ranking product</li><li>Best repeat-visit loop</li><li>Higher risk of feeling financial</li></ul>
          <a href="/prototypes/live-index">View full prototype →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="option atlas-option">
        <a class="preview" href="/prototypes/systems-atlas" aria-label="Open Open Systems Atlas prototype">
          <div class="mini-nav"><i>◎</i><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>SEARCH</b></div>
          <div class="mini-atlas-title"><h2>Open(Source)<br /><em>Agent(s)</em> × <strong>(Ro)Bot</strong></h2><p>The living map of open intelligence.</p></div>
          <div class="mini-map"><div class="nodes"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><i>OPEN</i><div class="nodes"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
          <span class="open-cue">Open prototype ↗</span>
        </a>
        <div class="option-copy">
          <div><span>02</span><h2>Open Systems Atlas</h2></div>
          <p>More conceptual and ownable. It makes the relationship between software agents, open components and physical machines explicit.</p>
          <ul><li>Strongest brand narrative</li><li>Best Agent-to-Robot expression</li><li>Lower leaderboard density</li></ul>
          <a href="/prototypes/systems-atlas">View full prototype →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <footer><span>Recommended next step</span><p>Use Live Open Index as the product foundation, then bring Atlas relationship language into project pages and Robot discovery.</p></footer>
  </main>
</PrototypeLayout>

<style>
  :global(body) { background: #ecece7; color: #11140f; font-family: "Spline Sans", sans-serif; }
  .compare-page { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1480px; padding: 40px 28px 80px; }
  .compare-page > header { border-bottom: 1px solid #11140f; padding: 20px 0 55px; position: relative; }
  .back, .label { font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .6rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .label { color: #657064; position: absolute; right: 0; top: 20px; }
  .compare-page > header h1 { font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 7.7vw, 8.5rem); letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: .82; margin: 90px 0 30px; }
  .compare-page > header h1 em { color: #2858ff; font-style: normal; }
  .compare-page > header p { color: #596158; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 700px; }
  .options { display: grid; gap: 24px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding-top: 24px; }
  .option { border: 1px solid #11140f; }
  .preview { display: block; min-height: 470px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
  .open-cue { background: #11140f; bottom: 0; color: white; font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .56rem; opacity: 0; padding: 14px 18px; position: absolute; right: 0; text-transform: uppercase; transform: translateY(100%); transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s; }
  .preview:hover .open-cue { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .mini-nav { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid; display: grid; gap: 10px; grid-template-columns: 38px repeat(3, 1fr) auto; height: 46px; padding: 0 12px; }
  .mini-nav i { align-items: center; background: #11140f; color: #bdff35; display: flex; font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .45rem; font-style: normal; height: 25px; justify-content: center; width: 25px; }
  .mini-nav span { border-bottom: 1px solid; display: block; opacity: .35; }
  .mini-nav b { font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .38rem; }
  .index-option .preview { background: #f3f4ef; }
  .mini-index-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.45fr .55fr; min-height: 230px; }
  .mini-index-hero h2 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 4.7rem); letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: .8; margin: 0; padding: 48px 24px; }
  .mini-index-hero h2 em { color: #43a5ff; font-style: normal; }.mini-index-hero h2 strong { color: #ff653c; font-weight: 600; }
  .mini-index-hero aside { align-items: end; background: #0b0d0c; color: #bdff35; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 18px; }
  .mini-index-hero aside b { font-size: 3rem; }
  .mini-index-hero aside span { background: #bdff35; height: 4px; margin-top: 8px; width: 70%; }
  .mini-tape { background: #bdff35; border-bottom: 1px solid; border-top: 1px solid; font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .38rem; padding: 8px 12px; }
  .mini-boards { display: grid; gap: 8px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding: 14px; }
  .mini-boards > div { border: 1px solid; padding: 12px; }
  .mini-boards b { font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .42rem; }
  .mini-boards span { border-bottom: 1px solid #bec4ba; display: block; height: 24px; }
  .atlas-option .preview { background-color: #f3efe3; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(16,43,69,.07) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16,43,69,.07) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 18px 18px; color: #102b45; }
  .atlas-option .mini-nav i { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #102b45; color: #102b45; }
  .atlas-option .mini-nav b { background: #ff6c3b; padding: 8px; }
  .mini-atlas-title { align-items: end; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr .6fr; padding: 42px 24px 28px; }
  .mini-atlas-title h2 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.2vw, 4.5rem); letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: .8; margin: 0; }
  .mini-atlas-title h2 em { color: #00aabd; font-style: normal; }.mini-atlas-title h2 strong { color: #ff6c3b; font-weight: 600; }
  .mini-atlas-title p { border-left: 1px solid; font-size: .7rem; padding-left: 14px; }
  .mini-map { align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 90px 1fr; min-height: 145px; padding: 15px 28px; }
  .mini-map .nodes { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .mini-map .nodes span { background: #f3efe3; border: 1px solid; height: 24px; width: 80%; }
  .mini-map .nodes:last-child { align-items: end; }
  .mini-map i { align-items: center; background: #102b45; border-radius: 50%; color: #f3efe3; display: flex; font-family: "Martian Mono", monospace; font-size: .42rem; font-style: normal; height: 70px; justify-content: center; position: relative; width: 70px; }
  .mini-map i::before { border: 1px dashed #102b45; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; inset: -11px; position: absolute; }
  .option-copy { border-top: 1px solid #11140f; min-height: 310px; padding: 26px; }
  .option-copy > div { align-items: baseline; display: flex; gap: 14px; }
  .option-copy > div > span { font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .55rem; }
  .option-copy h2 { font-size: 2.1rem; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .option-copy > p { color: #596158; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 540px; }
  .option-copy ul { color: #596158; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; }
  .option-copy > a { border-bottom: 1px solid; display: inline-block; font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .54rem; margin-top: 18px; padding-bottom: 7px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .compare-page > footer { background: #11140f; color: #ecece7; display: grid; gap: 30px; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; margin-top: 24px; padding: 32px; }
  .compare-page > footer span { color: #bdff35; font-family: "Azeret Mono", monospace; font-size: .56rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .compare-page > footer p { font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; max-width: 750px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .preview { min-height: 430px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .compare-page { padding: 22px 12px 50px; }
    .label { display: block; margin-top: 18px; position: static; }
    .compare-page > header h1 { margin-top: 60px; }
    .mini-index-hero, .mini-atlas-title { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .mini-index-hero aside, .mini-atlas-title p { display: none; }
    .mini-index-hero h2, .mini-atlas-title h2 { font-size: 3.2rem; }
    .compare-page > footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
